The THALAMIC_NAMES mapping in brain_viewer/anatomy.py contains a selected,
reformatted mapping of thalamic label identifiers and names. Left/right prefixes
are generated by this application. The anatomical identifiers in PRESETS in
brain_viewer/segmentation.py also refer to the FreeSurfer lookup table.
These mappings are modified extracts, not the original complete lookup table.
The application's generated label colours are not a copy of the LUT RGB values.
Patient-specific FreeSurfer images and meshes are supplied by the user and are
not included in the proposed source distribution.

